        ],
        "text": "According to Mark C. Fleming, the dispute concerns whether a lawful permanent resident subject to deportation must have the same opportunity to seek discretionary relief as an alien who has temporarily left the country and is subject to exclusion proceedings."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
